From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 15:32:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Apply Figma design tokens to theme, buttons, inputs, badges

- Add src/tokens.css generated from Figma token exports
- Map shadcn HSL vars to bronze/neutral/ink palette (light mode)
- Pill buttons (flat), card-colored inputs, success/warning/danger badges
- Register success, warning, primary-glow and Figma radii in tailwind
- Update theme-color meta and PWA manifest to bronze
